/* generated from biginter : {A}tm (power (power A))⟶tm (power A) */

/* type biginter pi A \ tm (power (power A)) -> tm (power A). */

/* generated from biginterI : {A,K,x:tm A}({S}ded (in (power A) S K)⟶ded (in A x S))⟶ded (in A x (biginter A K)) */

ded X3 (in A x (biginter A K)) :- help/biginterI A K x X2 X3 , (pi S \ pi x1 \ ded/hyp x1 (in (power A) S K) => ded (X2 S x1) (in A x S)).

help/biginterI A K x (S \ x1 \ prodcert (X2/1 S x1) (X2/2 S x1)) (prodcert X3/1 X3/2) :- help/biginterI A K x X2/1 X3/1 , help/biginterI A K x X2/2 X3/2.

help/biginterI A K x (S \ x2 \ idcert X1) (idcert X3) :- X3 > 0 , X1 is X3 - 1.

help/biginterI A K x (S \ x2 \ ptcert X1) (ptcert (biginterI A K x X1)).

/* generated from biginterE : {A,K,x:tm A,S}ded (in A x (biginter A K))⟶ded (in (power A) S K)⟶ded (in A x S) */

ded X3 (in A x S) :- help/biginterE A K x S X1 X2 X3 , ded X1 (in A x (biginter A K)) , ded X2 (in (power A) S K).

help/biginterE A K x S (prodcert X1/1 X1/2) (prodcert X2/1 X2/2) (prodcert X3/1 X3/2) :- help/biginterE A K x S X1/1 X2/1 X3/1 , help/biginterE A K x S X1/2 X2/2 X3/2.

help/biginterE A K x S (idcert X1) (idcert X1) (idcert X2) :- X2 > 0 , X1 is X2 - 1.

help/biginterE A K x S (ptcert X1) (ptcert X1) (ptcert (biginterE A K x S X1 X1)).

